# data/

`data/` is text generated by commercial language models from Anthropic, OpenAI,
xAI and Google. It is released here so the paper's numbers can be checked.

No copyright is claimed over the model outputs. Whether machine-generated text
is copyrightable at all is unsettled, and this file does not try to settle it.

The parts of `data/` that are our own work — `MANIFEST.json`, `corpora.json`,
`lexicons.json`, the taxonomies, and the claim definitions — are MIT, same as
the code.

If you plan to redistribute the model outputs rather than just read them, check
the current terms of the provider whose model produced them.
